{"Guest emails are not normalized (case/base-email) before blacklist comparison, allowing bypass of BLACKLISTED_GUEST_EMAILS with different casing or plus-addressing": 0.8393232822418213, "addGuestsHandler requires user to be BOTH team admin AND team owner (using && instead of ||), blocking team admins who are not owners from adding guests to team bookings": 0.9414130449295044, "Line 168 passes the original unfiltered guests array to sendAddGuestsEmails instead of uniqueGuests, causing existing attendees to receive wrong email template (AttendeeScheduledEmail instead of AttendeeAddGuestsEmail)": 0.9089497327804565, "No server-side deduplication of guest emails, allowing duplicate attendee rows to be created for the same booking since there's no unique constraint on (bookingId, email)": 0.6293186545372009, "MultiEmail component uses useLocale() hook but is missing the 'use client' directive, which can break Next.js App Router usage when rendered from a Server Component": 0.5023810267448425}